            "id": "4951763",
            "title": "What Moved Markets This Week",
            "description": "<html><body><div class=\"wsb_wrapper\"> <div class=\"wsb_main\"><span><p data-eci=\"true\"><strong>Listen on the go! A daily podcast of Wall Street Breakfast will be available by 8:00 a.m. on <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/author/wall-street-breakfast?utm_source=newsletter&amp;utm_medium=toptext&amp;utm_campaign=wsbpodpromo\">Seeking Alpha</a>, <a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/wall-street-breakfast/id1358381502\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">iTunes</a>, <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/show/05uLjJxkVgQsRk8LWLCLpx\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Spotify</a>.</strong></p></span></div> <figure class=\"getty-figure\" data-type=\"getty-image\"><picture><img alt=\"\" data-id=\"2149977520\" data-type=\"getty-image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"1024\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 36px), (max-width: 1023px) calc(100vw - 132px), (max-width: 1199px) calc(100vw - 666px), (max-width: 1307px) calc(100vw - 708px), 600px\" src=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2149977520/image_2149977520.jpg?io=getty-c-w630\" srcset=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2149977520/image_2149977520.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536 1536w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2149977520/image_2149977520.jpg?io=getty-c-w1280 1280w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2149977520/image_2149977520.jpg?io=getty-c-w1080 1080w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2149977520/image_2149977520.jpg?io=getty-c-w750 750w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2149977520/image_2149977520.jpg?io=getty-c-w640 640w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2149977520/image_2149977520.jpg?io=getty-c-w480 480w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2149977520/image_2149977520.jpg?io=getty-c-w320 320w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2149977520/image_2149977520.jpg?io=getty-c-w240 240w\" width=\"1536\"/><figcaption><p class=\"item-credits\">Getty Images</p></figcaption></picture></figure>\n<p class=\"wsb_bold\" data-skip-content-styles=\"\"> </p> <p><span class=\"b\"><span class=\"italic\">Up for a challenge? Test your knowledge on the biggest events in the investing world over the past week. Take the latest</span> </span><span class=\"italic b\"><a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/quiz/71-investment-news-quiz-friday-oct-2-2026-10-02#source=section%3Amain_content%7Cbutton%3Abody_link\">Seeking Alpha News Quiz</a> </span><span class=\"b italic\">and see how you stack up against the competition.</span></p> <h2> </h2> <p><br/>Wall Street ended the week on a mixed note as cooler-than-expected September jobs data cut Fed rate-hike odds even as Treasury yields climbed, with the 30-year hitting its highest level in decades.<br/><br/>The September <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4649794-nonfarm-payrolls-cool-more-than-expected-in-september-unemployment-rate-ticks-up\" target=\"_blank\">nonfarm payrolls</a> report came in cooler than economists expected. U.S. employers added just 29K jobs in September, well short of the 85K consensus figure and a sharp slowdown from August’s downwardly revised gain of 133K.<br/><br/>Odds that the Federal Reserve will decide to raise <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4649846-october-rate-hike-odds-collapse-after-cooler-payrolls-print\" target=\"_blank\">rates</a> at its October 28 meeting collapsed this week after softer payrolls and cooler PCE inflation data landed as the probability of an October hike fell to 18.3% on Friday, down from 24.4% on Thursday and 64.2% a week ago.<br/><br/>Furthermore, yields remained at the center of attention as they climbed across the curve, with the longer-end U.S. 30-year U.S. Treasury yield (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/US30Y#source=section%3Amain_content%7Cbutton%3Abody_link%7Cfirst_level_url%3Anews\" target=\"_blank\">US30Y</a>) topping its highest level since <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4648118-us-30-year-treasury-yield-tags-559-its-highest-reading-since-2002\" target=\"_blank\">2002</a>.<br/><br/>For the week, the blue-chip Dow (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/DJI\" title=\"Dow Jones Industrial Average Index\">DJI</a>) fell <span class=\"red\">-1.26%</span>, the benchmark S&amp;P (<a class=\"ticker-link\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/SP500\">SP500</a>) lost <span class=\"red\">-0.27%</span>, and the tech-heavy Nasdaq Composite (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/COMP:IND\" title=\"NASDAQ Composite Index\">COMP:IND</a>) climbed <span class=\"green\">+0.45%</span>. Read a preview of next week's major events in <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4649772-catalyst-watch-microsoft-event-fomc-talk-and-the-finish-line-for-paramount-warner-bros\" target=\"_blank\">Seeking Alpha's Catalyst Watch.</a><br/> </p> <h2><a class=\"!no-underline !text-share-text\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4649793-ipo-timeline-delays\">More caution</a></h2> <p>Investors are scaling back expectations of an IPO rush this fall as several companies have delayed plans to go public amid market volatility and broader uncertainty. After a string of postponements from firms such as Oura (<a class=\"ticker-link\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/OURA\">OURA</a>) and Holtec (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/HNUC\" title=\"Holtec Nuclear Corporation\">HNUC</a>), the shift can't really be blamed on company-specific issues. What would it take for IPO activity to regain momentum? <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4649793-ipo-timeline-delays\"><span class=\"b\">Read more.</span></a></p> <p class=\"wsb_bold\" data-skip-content-styles=\"\">Seeking Alpha's Calls Of The Week</p> <p>Analog Devices (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/ADI\" title=\"Analog Devices, Inc.\">ADI</a>): Double-Digit <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4950521-analog-devices-stock-double-digit-growth-to-continue-into-2027\">Growth Set To Continue</a>.<br/><br/>Annaly Capital (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/NLY\" title=\"Annaly Capital Management, Inc.\">NLY</a>) Became A Buy <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4950993-annaly-capital-became-a-buy-at-15-percent-yield-and-1x-ptbv-rating-upgrade\">At 15% Forward Yield</a>.<br/><br/>Hims &amp; Hers (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/HIMS\" title=\"Hims &amp; Hers Health, Inc.\">HIMS</a>): Valuation <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4951088-hims-and-hers-us-revenue-reacceleration-is-reassuring-and-valuation-compression-is-compelling-upgrade\">Compression Is Compelling</a>.<br/><br/>Innodata's (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/INOD\" title=\"Innodata Inc.\">INOD</a>) 45% Pullback <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4951346-innodata-stock-45-percent-pullback-has-changed-my-view\">Has Changed My View</a>.<br/> <br/>UiPath (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/PATH\" title=\"UiPath, Inc.\">PATH</a>) May Be Worth <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4951211-uipath-worth-picking-up-at-this-price-rating-upgrade\">Picking Up At This Price</a>.<br/><br/>Here's <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4951199-im-cashing-out-of-bitmine-immersion-downgrade\">Why I'm Cashing Out</a> Of Bitmine Immersion (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/BMNR\" title=\"Bitmine Immersion Technologies, Inc.\">BMNR</a>).<br/><br/>Downgrading Iovance (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/IOVA\" title=\"Iovance Biotherapeutics, Inc.\">IOVA</a>) As <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4950800-iovance-the-turnaround-is-priced-in-downgrading-to-hold\">Turnaround Is Priced In</a>.<br/><br/>Westlake (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/WLK\" title=\"Westlake Corporation\">WLK</a>): Invest When It <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4950940-westlake-invest-when-it-gets-ugly-that-is-not-now-rating-downgrade\">Gets Ugly, That's Not Now</a>.<br/><br/>Medical Properties' (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/MPT\" title=\"Medical Properties Trust, Inc.\">MPT</a>) Refinancing <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4951157-medical-properties-trust-refinancing-bought-time-not-change-rating-downgrade\">Only Bought Time</a>.<br/><br/>Nike (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/NKE\" title=\"NIKE, Inc.\">NKE</a>) Earnings Review: Run <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4951472-nikes-earnings-run-away-while-you-can-downgrade\">Away While You Can</a>.</p> <p class=\"wsb_bold\" data-skip-content-styles=\"\">Weekly Movement</p> <p><span><strong>U.S. Indices</strong><br/>Dow <span class=\"red\">-1.3%</span> to 51,177. S&amp;P 500 <span class=\"red\">-0.3%</span> to 7,723. Nasdaq <span class=\"green\">+0.5%</span> to 27,191. Russell 2000 <span class=\"red\">-0.2%</span> to 2,833. CBOE Volatility Index <span class=\"green\">+3%</span> to 15.31. <br/><br/><strong>S&amp;P 500 Sectors</strong><br/>Consumer Staples <span class=\"red\">-1.9%</span>. Utilities <span class=\"green\">+0.7%</span>. Financials <span class=\"red\">-2.5%</span>. Telecom <span class=\"red\">-1.6%</span>. Healthcare <span class=\"red\">-2.7%</span>. Industrials <span class=\"red\">-0.3%</span>. Information Technology <span class=\"green\">+1.4%</span>. Materials <span class=\"red\">-1.6%</span>. Energy <span class=\"green\">+1.4%</span>. Consumer Discretionary <span class=\"red\">-0.2%</span>. Real Estate <span class=\"red\">-1.9%</span>. <br/><br/><strong>World Indices</strong><br/>London <span class=\"red\">-2.2%</span> to 10,462. France <span class=\"red\">-2.2%</span> to 7,897. Germany <span class=\"red\">-0.7%</span> to 25,231. Japan <span class=\"green\">+2.9%</span> to 68,309. China <span class=\"red\">-1.2%</span> to 3,842. Hong Kong <span class=\"red\">-2.2%</span> to 23,972. India <span class=\"red\">-2.7%</span> to 71,910. <br/><br/><strong>Commodities and Bonds</strong><br/>Crude Oil WTI <span class=\"red\">-1.2%</span> to $91.26/bbl. Gold <span class=\"red\">-3.5%</span> to $4,172.1/oz. Natural Gas <span class=\"red\">-5.7%</span> to 3.04. Ten-Year Bond Yield -0.2 bps to 5.277. <br/><br/><strong>Forex and Cryptos</strong><br/>EUR/USD <span class=\"red\">-1.22%</span>. USD/JPY <span class=\"green\">+0.37%</span>. GBP/USD <span class=\"red\">-0.1%</span>. Bitcoin <span class=\"green\">+0.3%</span>. Litecoin <span class=\"red\">-3.4%</span>. Ethereum <span class=\"red\">-0.7%</span>. XRP <span class=\"red\">-2.5%</span>. <br/><br/><strong>Top S&amp;P 500 Gainers</strong><br/>Carnival Corporation &amp; plc (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/CCL\" title=\"Carnival Corporation Ltd.\">CCL</a>) <span class=\"green\">+16%</span>. Lumentum Holdings (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/LITE\" title=\"Lumentum Holdings Inc.\">LITE</a>) <span class=\"green\">+15%</span>. Synopsys (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/SNPS\" title=\"Synopsys, Inc.\">SNPS</a>) <span class=\"green\">+15%</span>. Royal Caribbean Cruises (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/RCL\" title=\"Royal Caribbean Cruises Ltd.\">RCL</a>) <span class=\"green\">+14%</span>. Coherent (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/COHR\" title=\"Coherent Corp.\">COHR</a>) <span class=\"green\">+14%</span>. <br/><br/><strong>Top S&amp;P 500 Losers</strong><br/>Fair Isaac (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/FICO\" title=\"Fair Isaac Corporation\">FICO</a>) <span class=\"red\">-23%</span>. AppLovin (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/APP\" title=\"AppLovin Corporation\">APP</a>) <span class=\"red\">-14%</span>. Global Payments (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/GPN\" title=\"Global Payments Inc.\">GPN</a>) <span class=\"red\">-9%</span>. Western Digital (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/WDC\" title=\"Western Digital Corporation\">WDC</a>) <span class=\"red\">-9%</span>. International Paper (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/IP\" title=\"International Paper Company\">IP</a>) <span class=\"red\">-9%</span>. <br/><br/><i>Where will the markets be headed next week? Current trends and ideas? Add your thoughts to the comments section.</i></span></p> </div></body></html>",
