            "title": "Taylor Devices: Another Ugly Quarter Could Set Up A Big Rebound",
            "description": "<html><body><p data-eci=\"true\"><figure class=\"getty-figure\" data-type=\"getty-image\"><picture> <img alt=\"Missile Engaging Drone in Mid-Air Against Dramatic Sunset Sky\" data-id=\"2188566138\" data-type=\"getty-image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"1024\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 36px), (max-width: 1023px) calc(100vw - 132px), (max-width: 1199px) calc(100vw - 666px), (max-width: 1307px) calc(100vw - 708px), 600px\" src=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2188566138/image_2188566138.jpg?io=getty-c-w630\" srcset=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2188566138/image_2188566138.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536 1536w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2188566138/image_2188566138.jpg?io=getty-c-w1280 1280w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2188566138/image_2188566138.jpg?io=getty-c-w1080 1080w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2188566138/image_2188566138.jpg?io=getty-c-w750 750w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2188566138/image_2188566138.jpg?io=getty-c-w640 640w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2188566138/image_2188566138.jpg?io=getty-c-w480 480w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2188566138/image_2188566138.jpg?io=getty-c-w320 320w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2188566138/image_2188566138.jpg?io=getty-c-w240 240w\" width=\"1536\"/> </picture><figcaption><p class=\"item-caption\"> </p> <p class=\"item-credits\">bymuratdeniz/iStock via Getty Images</p></figcaption></figure></p>  <h2>Investment Thesis</h2> <p>Taylor Devices (<span class=\"ticker-hover-wrapper\"><a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/TAYD\" title=\"Taylor Devices, Inc.\">TAYD</a></span>) just reported another ugly quarter, but revenue keeps falling while the backlog reaches new highs, and the unusual gross margin and working-ca